---
import BackToTop from './BackToTop.astro';
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <div class="footer-title">夜泊 · THE ANCHORAGE</div>
      <p class="footer-quote">
        “江上之清风，与山间之明月，耳得之而为声，目遇之而成色，取之无禁，用之不竭。”
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-divider"></div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p class="copyright">
        © {currentYear} 夜泊 · 行于万顷波涛，止于片刻宁静。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<!-- 全局右下角一键置顶 -->
<BackToTop />

<style>
  .site-footer {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    background: #020610;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
  }

  .footer-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-quote {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #64748b;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .footer-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15), transparent);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
  }

  .footer-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .status-indicator {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #2dd4bf;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px #2dd4bf;
  }
</style>

